  <summary>Share a keyboard and mouse, with experimental file dragging</summary>
  <description>
    <p>FlowPlus shares a keyboard, mouse and clipboard between computers. It is derived from Deskflow and adds an experimental file transfer workflow inspired by the LocalSend protocol.</p>
    <p>File transfer between Windows and macOS requires a reachable connection, for example on a local network or VPN. The application does not include an Internet relay or automatic NAT traversal.</p>
  </description>
